From: turbo-boo <59400127+turbo-boo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 13:41:51 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] thermal: Use quiet_therm for SKIN temperature type

Point the SKIN temperature type at the quiet_therm sensor instead of
sys-therm-2, which is not present on this platform.

Change-Id: I8f1f96f3625b583f677926648883727409ae60f8
---
 thermalConfig.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/thermalConfig.cpp b/thermalConfig.cpp
index 31e95d2..8b55959 100644
--- a/thermalConfig.cpp
+++ b/thermalConfig.cpp
@@ -1954,7 +1954,7 @@ namespace thermal {
 		},
 		{
 			TemperatureType::SKIN,
-			{ "sys-therm-2" },
+			{ "quiet_therm" },
 			"skin",
 			{
 			[LIGHT] = 48000,
